	measure 'Fecha de corte de información' = CALCULATE ( MAX ( FACT_INASISTENCIAS[FechaFin] ), REMOVEFILTERS ( FACT_INASISTENCIAS ), REMOVEFILTERS ( DIM_CALENDARIO ), REMOVEFILTERS ( DIM_APRENDIZ ), REMOVEFILTERS ( DIM_FICHA ), REMOVEFILTERS ( DIM_PROGRAMA ) )
